WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
When would you like to move, and

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.520
what would you need to know before

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.620
deciding? Those are two different questions.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.480
Your preferred date can sit beside your

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.800
lease commitments, the payment you want and

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.620
the cash you expect to need.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.560
If an answer is missing, choose a

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.480
next step that helps you find it,

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.060
rather than picking a purchase deadline first.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.960
That could be asking about an estimate

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.420
or checking a lease date.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.480
Choose who to ask and when to

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.120
check back. The planning worksheet brings that

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.940
next step together. Review before sending your

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.520
answers to me, or print the page

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.570
for yourself.
